ment is researched and based on museum collections and contemporary art, offering an authentic experience of each era's style. You can also read more about historical fashion in our info menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692430/extras/a906555caf326f336b55f2eaf0ca0261.avif?t=1769769379\" width=1560 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692430/extras/ff75ce3cb3df5e015b702d459bad859d.poster.avif?t=1769769379\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692430/extras/ff75ce3cb3df5e015b702d459bad859d.webm?t=1769769379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the appearance of your characters. Experiment with facial features, hairstyles, accessories, and more to bring your character to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692430/extras/7068677f8cef6b7e411b15f74421f011.avif?t=1769769379\" width=1560 height=244 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692430/extras/5cde498c7931172fa77f06c0e0aa9959.poster.avif?t=1769769379\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692430/extras/5cde498c7931172fa77f06c0e0aa9959.webm?t=1769769379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692430/extras/5cde498c7931172fa77f06c0e0aa9959.mp4?t=1769769379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Save screenshots of your favorite characters and outfits. Share your creations with friends or use them as inspiration for your next design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692430/extras/466d656c3b39934e4d45fd5478abe26a.avif?t=1769769379\" width=1560 height=244 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692430/extras/4b5ad8cc8e4aa374e10691f68331bd7a.poster.avif?t=1769769379\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692430/extras/4b5ad8cc8e4aa374e10691f68331bd7a.webm?t=1769769379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692430/extras/4b5ad8cc8e4aa374e10691f68331bd7a.mp4?t=1769769379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Bring your digital creations to life by printing out your characters as charming paper dolls. Print in color, or color the dolls yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692430/extras/efb233c18ea37d743becc1d9f9b71bda.avif?t=1769769379\" width=1560 height=244 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692430/extras/ea72ab3f8dedd5f8ba5f8e9003115038.poster.avif?t=1769769379\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692430/extras/ea72ab3f8dedd5f8ba5f8e9003115038.webm?t